  "evidence": "stg_orders has 14,790 rows vs raw.orders 15,000 rows (210 missing). The stg_orders model filters on o_orderdate < '1998-07-01', dropping all orders on or after that date. stg_lineitem retains all 60,175 rows, so 801 lineitem rows reference order_keys that were filtered out, causing the FK relationship check to fail. The freshness check also fails (1 stale row) because the filter prevents recent orders from being loaded, making the latest loaded_at older than expected. The problem originates in the stg_orders SQL filter, not in the source data."
